---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for My Fortune — what data we collect (very little), and how it's used.">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: August 2026</p>

  <p>
    This policy explains what information My Fortune collects, how it's used, and the
    choices you have. We've tried to write it in plain language rather than dense legal
    text, because the honest answer is: we collect very little.
  </p>

  <h2>What we don't collect</h2>
  <p>
    My Fortune has no user accounts, no login system, and no backend database. We do not
    collect your name, email address, or any personal profile information. Photos used in
    the Palm Reader game are processed entirely on your own device and are never uploaded
    to any server — we have no way to see them, and never do.
  </p>

  <h2>Local storage</h2>
  <p>
    Some games use your browser's <code>localStorage</code> to remember which questions
    you've already seen, so returning visitors get fresh content instead of repeats. This
    data lives only in your browser, is never transmitted to us or anyone else, and can be
    cleared at any time through your browser settings.
  </p>

  <h2>Destiny Links</h2>
  <p>
    Several games let you generate a shareable "Destiny Link" to compare results with a
    friend. The data behind that link (your answers or result summary) is encoded directly
    into the URL itself — it is never stored on a server. Anyone you send the link to can
    decode and view that data, so only share it with people you intend to.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    We use Google Analytics to understand overall traffic patterns — for example, which
    games are most popular — so we can improve the site. Google Analytics may use cookies
    and collect standard technical information such as your approximate location, device
    type, and browser. This data is aggregated and is not used to personally identify you.
    You can opt out of Google Analytics tracking using a browser extension such as the
    official <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Camera access</h2>
  <p>
    The Palm Reader game may request access to your device camera to scan your palm. This
    permission is requested by your browser directly, is entirely optional (you can upload
    a photo instead), and the resulting image is processed only in your browser — never
    uploaded anywhere.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party services</h2>
  <p>
    Some games load fonts, icon libraries, or a canvas-export library from third-party
    content delivery networks (CDNs) to function. These requests may be visible to those
    providers as standard web traffic (e.g. your IP address), governed by their own
    privacy policies.
  </p>

  <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>
    My Fortune is intended for a general audience and does not knowingly collect personal
    information from anyone, including children. Since no accounts or personal data
    collection exist on this site, no age-specific data is retained.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy as the site evolves. Material changes will be reflected by
    updating the "Last updated" date above.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy? Reach out via our <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}contact`}>Contact page</a>.
  </p>

  <p style="font-size:12px; color:#6b6880; margin-top:30px;">
    This page is a general template and is not a substitute for legal advice. If you have
    specific compliance obligations (for example GDPR, CCPA, or requirements in your
    jurisdiction), please have this reviewed by a qualified professional before relying on
    it.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>